{"id":"e_quilibre","lemma":"équilibre","pos":"noun","rank":2800,"glosses":["balance, equilibrium"],"ipa":"/e.ki.libʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/Fr-%C3%A9quilibre.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9quilibre.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"équilibres"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai perdu l'équilibre.","en":"I lost my balance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Un subtil équilibre doit être trouvé.","en":"A delicate balance must be reached.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"subtle"},null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"}]},{"text":"J'essaye de regagner mon équilibre.","en":"I'm trying to regain my balance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to regain, to recover"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes tout juste à l'équilibre.","en":"We're breaking even.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"L'équilibre de la nature est très fragile.","en":"The balance of nature is very fragile.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"plain, unseasoned"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"fragile"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}